#define WAITING ["Blink, %s, and I might just appear right behind you.","Ignoring a demon, %s? A foolish strategy.","Did you miss the smell of brimstone, %s, or are you just playing dumb?","Poof! Right here, %s. Try ignoring me now.","Your silence amuses me, %s... but it won't protect you.","Look around, %s. You can't outrun or out-ignore spatial teleportation.","Hello, %s. I suggest you turn around before things get fiery.","Ignoring me, %s? Perhaps I should teleport your wallet away.","%s, my blades are sharp, and my patience is short.","A demon stands before you, %s. Show some basic awareness.","Did I startle you, %s? You seem terribly distracted.","Don't pretend you didn't see me teleport in, %s.","Over here, %s! Don't make me grab you by the tail.","Your lack of attention is dangerously naive, %s.","Look at me, %s, before I make you vanish into the underworld!"]
